---
const updated = "22 March 2026";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Refund policy — NotionFlow</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;1,9..40,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --ink: #0f0e0d; --ink-2: #3d3b38; --ink-3: #7a7772;
      --paper: #faf9f7; --paper-2: #f0ede8; --paper-3: #e4e0d9;
      --accent: #3B5BDB; --teal: #0d8a6a; --teal-2: #e0f5ee;
      --serif: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
      --sans: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    }
    body { font-family: var(--sans); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6; }
    nav {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 clamp(1.5rem,5vw,4rem); height: 64px;
      background: var(--paper); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-3);
    }
    .nav-logo { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-logo span { color: var(--accent); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a { font-size: .875rem; color: var(--ink-2); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    .page { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem) clamp(1.5rem,5vw,4rem); }
    .page-label { font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: .875rem; }
    .page-title { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.5rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
    .page-updated { font-size: .8125rem; color: var(--ink-3); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .guarantee-card {
      background: var(--teal-2); border: 1px solid var(--teal);
      border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    .gc-title { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.375rem; color: var(--teal); margin-bottom: .625rem; }
    .gc-text { font-size: 1rem; color: #0a5c48; line-height: 1.75; }
    .prose h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.375rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 .875rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .prose p { font-size: .9875rem; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .prose ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .prose li { font-size: .9875rem; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: .375rem; }
    .prose a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    .prose a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .prose strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }
    .cta-block {
      background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--paper-3); border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; text-align: center;
    }
    .cta-title { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
    .cta-sub { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--ink-3); line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .cta-btn {
      display: inline-block; background: var(--accent); color: #fff;
      padding: .75rem 1.75rem; border-radius: 10px; font-size: .9375rem;
      font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity .15s;
    }
    .cta-btn:hover { opacity: .88; }
    footer { background: var(--paper-2); border-top: 1px solid var(--paper-3); padding: 2rem clamp(1.5rem,5vw,4rem); margin-top: 4rem; }
    .footer-inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; list-style: none; }
    .footer-links a { font-size: .875rem; color: var(--ink-3); text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    .footer-copy { font-size: .8125rem; color: var(--ink-3); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <a href="/" class="nav-logo">Notion<span>Flow</span></a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="/templates">Templates</a></li>
    <li><a href="/blog">Blog</a></li>
    <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<div class="page">
  <p class="page-label">Legal</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">Refund policy</h1>
  <p class="page-updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

  <div class="guarantee-card">
    <div class="gc-title">30-day guarantee — no questions asked</div>
    <div class="gc-text">
      If you set up the template, use it with a client, and genuinely don't think it was worth
      what you paid — email <a href="mailto:piercel.coder2022@gmail.com" style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:500">hello@notionflow.com</a>
      within 30 days and I'll refund you in full. No forms, no hoops, no questions asked.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>The spirit of this policy</h2>
    <p>I build these templates because they genuinely solve a real problem for agencies. If one of them doesn't deliver value for you, I don't want your money. A refund request is more useful to me as feedback than the sale is as revenue — it tells me what to fix or improve.</p>

    <h2>How to request a refund</h2>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:piercel.coder2022@gmail.com">hello@notionflow.com</a> within 30 days of purchase. Include your order number (in your Gumroad receipt) and a sentence about what didn't work for you. I'll process the refund within 2 business days and you'll receive confirmation from Gumroad.</p>

    <h2>What the guarantee covers</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>All individual template purchases</li>
      <li>Template bundles</li>
      <li>The full purchase price including any applicable fees</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Setup services</h2>
    <p>Done-for-you Notion build services are not covered by the 30-day refund policy once work has commenced. If you have concerns about a service engagement, contact me before the work begins and we will find a solution that works for both parties.</p>

    <h2>One honest ask</h2>
    <p>The guarantee exists because I'm confident the templates deliver value when set up correctly. Before requesting a refund, check that you watched the Loom walkthrough and completed the setup checklist — most issues people run into are resolved by the setup guide. If you're stuck, email me first and I'll help you get it working. But if after that it still doesn't work for your situation, the refund is yours with no further discussion needed.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-block">
    <div class="cta-title">Still have questions?</div>
    <div class="cta-sub">Email me directly — I read and reply to every message personally, usually within a few hours.</div>
    <a href="mailto:piercel.coder2022@gmail.com" class="cta-btn">hello@notionflow.com</a>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <ul class="footer-links">
      <li><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></li>
      <li><a href="/terms">Terms</a></li>
      <li><a href="/refunds">Refunds</a></li>
      <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="footer-copy">© 2026 NotionFlow</p>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>